+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: the standard trace-Gram matrix adjoint uses O(n^3) GF(3) "
+        "operations (measured at the shipping preset in selftest_report.json), "
+        "while trace/Frobenius adjunction is one n-coordinate rotation and one "
+        "sign change, at most 2n+8 exact operations."
